<title>USA: Western Staff to buyback up to 84,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Western Staff to buyback up to 84,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WALNUT CREEK, Calif 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Staff Services Inc said Tuesday that it plans to repurchase up to 84,000 shares of its outstanding common stock in the open market over the next twelve months.</p>
<p>The company said it would pay prevailing market prices and not more than $14 per share.</p>
<p>Western Staff shares closed Tuesday up 5/8 at 7-7/8.</p>
<p>The buyback is in addition to 16,000 shares that Western Staff recently bought under a previous plan, the company said.</p>
